---
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="About Forest Visual Tales"
	description="A company about empathy"
	pubDate={new Date('July 20 2026')}
	heroImage="/blog-placeholder-about.jpg"
>
	<p>
		Formed in June of 2026, this company is run, operated and all of the content is created by
		a single person. All of the stroies are lovingly drawn by hand with zero AI content. This
		company prioritizes the human touch over churning out content. The creator and only employee
		was tired of AI generated content crowding out human-created content and of employees being
		pushed to use AI despite the environmental impacts and job displacement impacts. This company
		was formed to show that stories made by humans have a beating heart that AI can't replicate.
	</p>

	<p>
		At current time, the primary and only project is Haru Hayashi, a manga about a corporate
		Creative Specialist who gets a higher calling to defend her favorite forest and the people
		around it. She is flighty, easily distracted, unserious and annoys the hell out of the 
		guardian spirit that gave her the powers she manifests. Normally, this is where the synopsis
		says "despite the flaws", but her flaws are a part of who she is as a person and a beautiful
		part of it. Her biggest strengths are her empathy and creativity that was misapplied and
		wasted at a 9-5 job and she gets to step into a role that aligns with her soul mission.
	</p>

	<p>
		Along the way, she meets numerous allies and antagonists, all with their own flaws and
		strengths. Rather than being cookie cutter villains that thirst to do evil for the sake of
		evil, the villains all have motivations and personalities.
	</p>

	<p>
		I hope you enjoy reading her adventure!
	</p>
</Layout>
